WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:39.291
Tom was at the Royal Fair.

2
00:00:39.292 --> 00:00:46.315
"It's almost time for the joust, Cat," he whispered.

3
00:00:46.316 --> 00:00:50.706
The bad knight rode over to Tom.

4
00:00:50.707 --> 00:00:54.384
"I'm glad I won that free magic spell," he said.

5
00:00:54.385 --> 00:00:59.654
"The prize money will be mine!"

6
00:00:59.655 --> 00:01:04.358
The joust began.

7
00:01:04.359 --> 00:01:17.965
Horses charged and lances clashed.

8
00:01:17.966 --> 00:01:20.644
Soon it was the bad knight's turn.

9
00:01:20.645 --> 00:01:23.093
He rode toward another knight.

10
00:01:23.094 --> 00:01:29.670
Tom watched from his seat.

11
00:01:29.671 --> 00:01:35.960
Suddenly the bad knight's horse swayed back and forth.

12
00:01:35.961 --> 00:01:38.759
"Uh-oh," cried Princess Mary.

13
00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:43.048
The bad knight dropped his lance!

14
00:01:43.049 --> 00:01:46.734
The other knight's lance struck the bad knight.

15
00:01:46.735 --> 00:01:53.549
Oof! The bad knight crashed to the ground.

16
00:01:53.550 --> 00:02:01.855
The other knight won the joust!

17
00:02:01.856 --> 00:02:07.925
"Our plan worked, Cat!" Tom whispered.

18
00:02:07.926 --> 00:02:13.460
The bad knight stomped toward Tom.

19
00:02:13.461 --> 00:02:17.087
"What happened, Wizard?" said the knight.

20
00:02:17.088 --> 00:02:20.410
"I was supposed to win!"

21
00:02:20.411 --> 00:02:24.658
"I still owe you one spell," said Tom.

22
00:02:24.659 --> 00:02:29.103
"Someday I'll do it, but I won't help you cheat!"

23
00:02:29.104 --> 00:02:31.723
Dirk was sitting nearby.

24
00:02:31.724 --> 00:02:37.186
"Cheat?" he cried. "Who's cheating?

25
00:02:37.187 --> 00:02:40.414
Cheaters go in the Grim Dungeon!"

26
00:02:40.415 --> 00:02:44.924
The knight gulped.

27
00:02:44.925 --> 00:02:48.104
"Um . . . Nobody's cheating!"

28
00:02:48.105 --> 00:02:50.376
He glanced at Tom.

29
00:02:50.377 --> 00:02:53.080
"I'll be back, Wizard!"

30
00:02:53.081 --> 00:03:03.583
Then the knight ran off.

31
00:03:03.584 --> 00:03:06.214
"Whew!" said Tom.

32
00:03:06.215 --> 00:03:09.200
"I'm glad he's gone, Cat.

33
00:03:09.201 --> 00:03:12.510
Do you think he'll really come back?"

34
00:03:12.511 --> 00:03:15.809
Cat licked her paw.

35
00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:25.521
"Perhaps. Perhaps not."
